EXPLANATION = {"title": "Voxel Occupancy", "principle": "Structures show an average of at least 2.0 occupied grid voxels per residue.", "rationale": "LAW-155 is defined and advisory (D3 / Part-16). The historical voxel-occupancy measurement is a heuristic signal (threshold 2.0 V on the atomic grid); it does not measure interatomic overlap (LAW-130) and does not contribute to scoring or veto verdicts."}
